      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Mayor's Trophy Game will be played this year between the Yankees and the Dodgers at Yankee Stadium on the night of June 14th. As you know, the entire proceeds from this annual event go to providing equipment for our youngsters on the sandlot teams.",
